    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "VILEPLUME’s toxic pollen triggers\natrocious allergy attacks. That’s why\nit is advisable never to approach any\fattractive flowers in a jungle, however\npretty they may be.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
