    {
      "flavor_text": "はなびらが　おおきいほど　たくさん\nかふんを　だすが　あたまが\nおもたくて　つかれてしまうという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꽃잎이 클수록 많은\n꽃가루를 만들어 내지만 머리가\n무거워서 지쳐버린다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Plus ses pétales sont grands, plus ils contiennent de\npollen toxique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Je größer die Blütenblätter, desto mehr giftige\nPollen sind in der Blüte enthalten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuanto mayores son sus pétalos, más tóxico es su\npolen. Le pesa la cabeza y le cuesta mantenerla\nerguida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Più grandi sono i petali, maggiore è la quantità di\npolline tossico che contengono. La testa è\nmolto pesante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The larger its petals, the more toxic pollen it\ncontains. Its big head is heavy and hard to hold up.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "花びらが　大きいほど\nたくさん　花粉を　出すが\n頭が　重たくて　疲れてしまうという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuanto mayores son sus pétalos, más tóxico es su\npolen. Le pesa la cabeza y le cuesta mantenerla\nerguida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "せかいいち　おおきな　はなびらは\nあるくたびに　ゆれて　たいりょうの\nどくかふんを　ばらまいてしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "세계에서 제일 큰 꽃잎은\n걸을 때마다 흔들려 대량의\n독 꽃가루를 흩뿌린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il possède des pétales énormes. À chaque pas,\nils sèment d’épais nuages de pollen toxique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es besitzt die größten Blätter der Welt.\nBei jedem Schritt streut es Giftpollen zu Boden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tiene los pétalos más grandes del mundo. Estos\nexpulsan densas nubes de polen tóxico al caminar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha i petali più grandi del mondo. Ad ogni suo passo,\ni petali liberano fitte nubi di polline tossico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has the world’s largest petals. With every step,\nthe petals shake out heavy clouds of toxic pollen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "世界一　大きな　花びらは\n歩くたびに　揺れて　大量の\n毒花粉を　ばらまいている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tiene los pétalos más grandes del mundo. Estos\nexpulsan densas nubes de polen tóxico al caminar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どくかふんは　ひどい　アレルギーを　おこす。\nジャングルで　うつくしい　はなを　みつけても\nうかつに　ちかよらない　ほうが　いいよ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "독 꽃가루는 심한 알레르기를 일으킨다.\n정글에서 아름다운 꽃을 발견해도\n섣불리 다가가지 않는 것이 좋다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le pollen toxique de Rafflesia déclenche d’affreuses réactions\nallergiques. C’est pourquoi il est conseillé de ne jamais\ns’approcher des jolies fleurs trouvées dans la jungle,\nmême lorsqu’elles sont magnifiques.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Giflors giftige Pollen rufen böse allergische Anfälle hervor.\nDeshalb ist es ratsam, sich keiner schönen Blume im\nDschungel zu nähern, so anziehend sie auch sein mag.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El polen que contienen las esporas tóxicas de Vileplume causa\nunos ataques de alergia muy agudos. Por eso, no es\naconsejable acercarse a ninguna flor selvática, por muy bonita\nque sea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il polline velenoso di Vileplume scatena paurose reazioni\nallergiche. Per questo motivo si consiglia di non avvicinarsi\nmai a nessun fiore di bosco, per quanto bello possa essere.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
